Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.40,0:00:05.30,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,550)\pos(1320,405)}有你，兄弟同心
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.70,0:00:05.30,Small,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,550)\pos(1320,515)}献给拿督斯里谢惠福
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.00,0:00:05.30,Dedication,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,550)\fs61\pos(1320,600)\c&H0096D5F1&}Hock Siew
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.30,0:00:25.36,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}一月六号那一天
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.64,0:00:29.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}浅顶迎来一份缘
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.54,0:00:32.76,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}拿督斯里谢惠福
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.02,0:00:36.72,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}从此写下你的篇章
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.90,0:00:39.82,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}一颗宽容厚道的心
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.40,0:00:43.18,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}装着兄弟的冷暖
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.48,0:00:47.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}尤其弟弟们的敬爱
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.56,0:00:51.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}来自你一路的关怀
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.66,0:00:54.30,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}相聚从来不是偶然
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.50,0:00:57.72,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}是你把真心连起来
Dialogue: 2,0:00:58.18,0:01:02.34,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}有人遇到风雨阻碍
Dialogue: 2,0:01:02.34,0:01:05.94,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}你总愿意伸手分担
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.00,0:01:09.36,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}无私奉献，不求喝彩
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.46,0:01:12.70,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}把情义放在心里面
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.40,0:01:17.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}一句兄弟，一份牵挂
Dialogue: 2,0:01:17.10,0:01:21.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}岁月走过依然不变
Dialogue: 2,0:01:21.04,0:01:24.86,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}Hock Siew，Hock Siew
Dialogue: 2,0:01:24.92,0:01:26.78,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}兄弟把你记在心头
Dialogue: 2,0:01:26.78,0:01:28.62,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}你的宽容，你的守候
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.64,0:01:30.40,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}让大家并肩一起走
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.42,0:01:32.28,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}Hock Siew，Hock Siew
Dialogue: 2,0:01:32.30,0:01:34.20,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}情义细水永远长流
Dialogue: 2,0:01:34.34,0:01:37.12,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}从浅顶唱到马来西亚
Dialogue: 2,0:01:37.14,0:01:42.92,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}愿这份真心传到更远的地方
Dialogue: 2,0:01:59.42,0:02:02.88,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}今天我们聚在你身旁
Dialogue: 2,0:02:02.90,0:02:06.34,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}把感谢都唱成祝愿
Dialogue: 2,0:02:06.64,0:02:10.50,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}愿你健康，愿你平安
Dialogue: 2,0:02:10.50,0:02:13.74,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}每个明天都有笑颜
Dialogue: 2,0:02:13.96,0:02:17.68,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}你为大家付出的点滴
Dialogue: 2,0:02:17.80,0:02:21.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}我们一件一件记心间
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.26,0:02:24.74,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}这一杯敬相识的缘
Dialogue: 2,0:02:24.74,0:02:28.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}这一首唱不变的情
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.32,0:02:32.80,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}Hock Siew，Hock Siew
Dialogue: 2,0:02:32.92,0:02:34.78,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}兄弟同心，携手向前走
Dialogue: 2,0:02:34.80,0:02:36.58,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}拿督斯里谢惠福
Dialogue: 2,0:02:36.64,0:02:38.34,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}这份敬爱藏在心头
Dialogue: 2,0:02:38.40,0:02:40.22,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}Hock Siew，Hock Siew
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.44,0:02:42.06,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}风雨同路，情义长留
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.10,0:02:43.92,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}愿你平安，幸福永久
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.08,0:02:50.10,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,100)}兄弟相伴，一起到白头！
